<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Statutory transit paperwork serves as the backbone of a compliant shipment.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The primary document here is the **GST e-Way Bill**, a mandatory digital document that validates the movement of goods across state borders.</span></li></ul>
<p>Without a valid e-Way Bill, your shipment can be detained at checkpoints, causing significant delays. To mitigate this, reputable services like <strong>Kani Packers and Movers Velachery</strong> ensure that all e-Way Bills are generated correctly and linked to the specific consignment details before dispatch.</p>

<p>Alongside the e-Way Bill, you will receive an **IBA-approved Lorry Receipt (LR) or Bilty**. This document acts as the contract of carriage between you and the transporter.</p>
<p>It details the contents, weight, and route of the shipment. For domestic moves, this standard LR is sufficient, but for specialized services such as a <strong>bike parcel service in Velachery</strong>, specific clauses regarding two-wheeler handling and security are often appended to the bilty to ensure accountability throughout the transit period.</p>

<p>Perhaps the most vital aspect of risk management is insurance. Standard transit cover often excludes full replacement value, which is why comprehensive **100% declared-value IRDAI marine transit insurance** is essential. This coverage protects against accidental collisions, theft, fire, and unforeseen delays that might compromise the integrity of your goods.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">It is particularly relevant if you are considering complex logistics, such as how to <strong>shift furniture to Hong Kong from India</strong>, where international marine insurance standards apply.</p>
